<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?><rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" version="2.0"><channel><title>World News, Today World News, Latest International News, World Breaking News, Trending News of World - Times of India</title><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world</link><description>World News Today: Read the latest world news headlines, Current International breaking news world wide. In depth analysis and top news headlines world wide.</description><language>en-gb</language><lastBuildDate>2026-08-19T09:11:06+05:30</lastBuildDate><atom:link type="application/rss+xml" rel="self" href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/rssfeeds/296589292.cms"/><copyright>Copyright:(C) Wed, 19 Aug 2026 09:11:06 IST Bennett Coleman &amp; Co. Ltd, http://in.indiatimes.com/policyterms/1554651.cms</copyright><docs>http://syndication.indiatimes.com/</docs><image><title>World News, Today World News, Latest International News, World Breaking News, Trending News of World - Times of India</title><url>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/507610.cms</url><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world</link></image><item><title><![CDATA[Democrat Angie Nixon defeats Alexander Vindman in surprise Florida Senate primary upset]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133336088.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Angie Nixon secured a surprise Democratic Senate primary victory in Florida.  She will now face Republican Ashley Moody in the general election.  Byron Donalds and David Jolly won their respective governor primary nominations.  New congressional maps are expected to favor Republicans significantly.  These primaries set the stage for Florida's November political direction.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/democrat-angie-nixon-defeats-alexander-vindman-in-surprise-florida-senate-primary-upset/articleshow/133336088.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/democrat-angie-nixon-defeats-alexander-vindman-in-surprise-florida-senate-primary-upset/articleshow/133336088.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-19T08:41:32+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133336221,imgsize-596709.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[US vs ICC row escalates: Trump administration sanctions international court president, senior lawyer]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133335289.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[In a significant escalation against the International Criminal Court (ICC), the United States has imposed sanctions on two prominent officials, including the ICC president and a senior trial lawyer. This move marks a continuation of the Trump administration's contentious stance towards the internationally recognized tribunal. The ICC criticized these sanctions as detrimental to the global legal framework, while several European allies voiced their concern over the U.S. actions.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/us-vs-icc-row-escalates-trump-administration-sanctions-international-court-president-senior-lawyer/articleshow/133335289.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/us-vs-icc-row-escalates-trump-administration-sanctions-international-court-president-senior-lawyer/articleshow/133335289.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-19T07:58:25+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Trisha Mahajan</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133335532,imgsize-80670.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Owens And Wilson Clash: Misogynistic slur ignites Kirk case debate; fractures conservative media]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133334513.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Candace Owens and Andrew Wilson clashed during a heated three-hour PBD Podcast debate over Charlie Kirk’s assassination and the case against Tyler Robinson. Owens questioned evidence and investigative details while Wilson defended the prosecution’s case. The discussion became more contentious when Owens brought up Wilson’s previous comment about Erika Kirk, Charlie Kirk’s widow. Wilson then made a sweeping and offensive remark about women, intensifying criticism surrounding the debate and its participants.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us-streamers/too-rtarded-to-kll-her-husband-candace-owens-confronts-andrew-wilson-over-charlie-kirk-claims-after-controversial-comments-about-erika-kirk/articleshow/133334513.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us-streamers/too-rtarded-to-kll-her-husband-candace-owens-confronts-andrew-wilson-over-charlie-kirk-claims-after-controversial-comments-about-erika-kirk/articleshow/133334513.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-19T05:31:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Global Sports Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133334514,imgsize-74276.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Streamer Confirms She Is Alive: JollyIRL says she’s hurt after bungee jump; fans reflect on stunt risks]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133334527.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[JollyIRL sparked widespread concern after her bungee jump livestream in Pattaya, Thailand, suddenly ended following a loud scream. The abrupt cutoff left viewers fearing she may have suffered a serious accident. The Kick streamer later confirmed she was alive and said her arm and neck were hurting, with possible whiplash. Fans expressed relief and discussed the risks of bungee jumping, while fellow streamer Sneako also voiced concern after watching the viral clip.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us-streamers/is-jollyirl-still-alive-kick-streamers-major-update-after-frightening-bungee-jump-incident/articleshow/133334527.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us-streamers/is-jollyirl-still-alive-kick-streamers-major-update-after-frightening-bungee-jump-incident/articleshow/133334527.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-19T05:52:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Global Sports Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133334534,imgsize-98398.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[IShowSpeed Eyes WWE Return: Streamer teases comeback on livestream; Logan Paul feud looms]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133334539.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[IShowSpeed has fueled speculation about another WWE appearance after teasing a return "very soon" during a recent livestream. The streamer last appeared at WrestleMania 42, teaming with Logan Paul and Austin Theory against The Usos and LA Knight. After their defeat, Paul turned on Speed, leading to a dramatic response when Speed drove him through an announce table. His latest tease could potentially set up another WWE storyline or renewed rivalry with Paul.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us-streamers/ishowspeed-teases-a-wwe-return-very-soon-after-wrestlemania-42-appearance-and-explosive-logan-paul-rivalry/articleshow/133334539.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us-streamers/ishowspeed-teases-a-wwe-return-very-soon-after-wrestlemania-42-appearance-and-explosive-logan-paul-rivalry/arti